### 1.2 Accumulation Factors

Both interest rates are applied over 182 days using ACT/360.

**USD accumulation factor:**

\[
DF_{USD}=1+R_{USD}\times\frac{T}{360}
\]

\[
=1+0.046\times\frac{182}{360}
\]

\[
\boxed{DF_{USD}=1.02325556}
\]

**EUR accumulation factor:**

\[
DF_{EUR}=1+R_{FC}\times\frac{T}{360}
\]

\[
=1+0.03361\times\frac{182}{360}
\]

\[
\boxed{DF_{EUR}=1.01699172}
\]

### 1.3 Option Premium Treatment

Both option premiums are paid upfront and carried to settlement using the USD accumulation factor.

**Put premium:**

\[
Premium_{PUT}=14,500,000\times0.0194
\]

\[
=\$281,300.00
\]

Carried to settlement:

\[
PREM_{PUT,FV}=281,300\times1.02325556
\]

\[
\boxed{\$287,841.79}
\]

**Call premium:**

\[
Premium_{CALL}=14,500,000\times0.0296
\]

\[
=\$429,200.00
\]

Carried to settlement:

\[
PREM_{CALL,FV}=429,200\times1.02325556
\]

\[
\boxed{\$439,181.28}
\]

The carried premiums are deducted from their respective option outcomes to compare all strategies at the same settlement date.

