5. The call does not protect the receivable and should remain a separate derivative payoff comparison.

The Stage 2 specification originally anticipated that the forward would win from 95% through 104%, while the unhedged strategy would win at 105%. However, after the Stage 4 input updates, the forward wins all eleven sensitivity scenarios because the assigned forward rate of 1.1705 exceeds the highest modeled settlement spot of 1.15164.

